# `Pulumi.dev.yaml`

Example dev config:

```yaml
config:
  aws:region: us-east-1

  canonical-app:vpcId: vpc-xxxxxxxx
  canonical-app:privateSubnetIds:
    - subnet-aaaaaaa
    - subnet-bbbbbbb
  canonical-app:dbSecurityGroupId: sg-xxxxxxxx

  canonical-app:oidcProviderArn: arn:aws:iam::123456789012:oidc-provider/oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/EXAMPLE
  canonical-app:oidcProviderUrl: https://oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/EXAMPLE

  canonical-app:k8sNamespace: app
  canonical-app:k8sServiceAccountName: web

  canonical-app:dbUsername: appuser
  canonical-app:dbName: appdb

  # Set via CLI as a secret in practice:
  # pulumi config set --secret canonical-app:dbPassword 'supersecret'
```

